1
00:00:00,134 --> 00:00:01,392
Tiga puluh Oktober,

2
00:00:01,412 --> 00:00:03,254
Mahkamah Agung membatalkan

3
00:00:03,274 --> 00:00:04,693
satu lembar surat milik Wakil

4
00:00:04,713 --> 00:00:05,742
Presiden Gibran.

5
00:00:05,762 --> 00:00:07,419
Tapi surat apa sebenarnya?

6
00:00:07,439 --> 00:00:08,534
Namanya surat keterangan

7
00:00:08,554 --> 00:00:09,710
penyetaraan, terbit enam

8
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:11,277
Agustus 2019.

9
00:00:11,297 --> 00:00:12,175
Isinya:

10
00:00:12,195 --> 00:00:13,645
pendidikan Gibran di UTS

11
00:00:13,665 --> 00:00:15,116
Insearch, Sydney,

12
00:00:15,136 --> 00:00:16,772
dinilai setara tamat SMK

13
00:00:16,792 --> 00:00:17,986
akuntansi.

14
00:00:18,006 --> 00:00:19,395
Penggugatnya advokat Subhan

15
00:00:19,415 --> 00:00:20,030
Palal.

16
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,655
Yang ia gugat adalah

17
00:00:21,675 --> 00:00:22,816
Kementerian Pendidikan Dasar

18
00:00:22,836 --> 00:00:23,736
dan Menengah,

19
00:00:23,756 --> 00:00:25,101
penerbit surat itu.

20
00:00:25,121 --> 00:00:25,859
Bukan Gibran,

21
00:00:25,879 --> 00:00:27,038
dan bukan KPU.

22
00:00:27,058 --> 00:00:28,245
Di PTUN,

23
00:00:28,265 --> 00:00:30,134
gugatannya tidak diterima,

24
00:00:30,154 --> 00:00:32,138
dan banding menguatkannya.

25
00:00:32,158 --> 00:00:33,221
Di tingkat kasasi,

26
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:34,212
Mahkamah Agung membalik

27
00:00:34,232 --> 00:00:34,998
semuanya:

28
00:00:35,018 --> 00:00:36,406
surat itu tidak sah,

29
00:00:36,426 --> 00:00:37,738
batal demi hukum,

30
00:00:37,758 --> 00:00:39,832
dan harus dimusnahkan.

31
00:00:39,852 --> 00:00:40,606
Enam Oktober,

32
00:00:40,626 --> 00:00:41,814
Mahkamah Konstitusi juga

33
00:00:41,834 --> 00:00:43,006
menyatakan tidak menemukan

34
00:00:43,026 --> 00:00:44,446
bukti meyakinkan bahwa Gibran

35
00:00:44,466 --> 00:00:45,405
punya ijazah luar negeri

36
00:00:45,425 --> 00:00:46,350
setara SMA.

37
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,331
Lalu, apakah jabatan wakil

38
00:00:48,351 --> 00:00:49,662
presiden ikut gugur?

39
00:00:49,682 --> 00:00:50,653
Pakar terbelah.

40
00:00:50,673 --> 00:00:51,845
Sebagian bilang otomatis

41
00:00:51,865 --> 00:00:52,467
gugur.

42
00:00:52,487 --> 00:00:53,607
Yang lain bilang tidak,

43
00:00:53,627 --> 00:00:55,016
karena ini perkara tata usaha

44
00:00:55,036 --> 00:00:56,239
negara terhadap penerbit

45
00:00:56,259 --> 00:00:56,812
surat.

46
00:00:56,832 --> 00:00:58,159
Undang-Undang Dasar hanya

47
00:00:58,179 --> 00:00:59,304
menyediakan satu jalan

48
00:00:59,324 --> 00:01:00,620
pemberhentian:

49
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,704
lewat DPR,

50
00:01:01,724 --> 00:01:03,081
Mahkamah Konstitusi,

51
00:01:03,101 --> 00:01:04,379
lalu MPR.

52
00:01:04,399 --> 00:01:05,370
Sejauh ini,

53
00:01:05,390 --> 00:01:06,933
KPU bilang tahapan pemilu

54
00:01:06,953 --> 00:01:08,156
sudah selesai.

55
00:01:08,176 --> 00:01:09,596
Menteri Abdul Mu'ti bilang

56
00:01:09,616 --> 00:01:10,679
belum ada proses hukum

57
00:01:10,699 --> 00:01:11,516
lanjutan.

58
00:01:11,536 --> 00:01:13,466
DPR menunggu salinan lengkap

59
00:01:13,486 --> 00:01:15,225
putusan, dan membuka masa

60
00:01:15,245 --> 00:01:16,564
sidang sepuluh November.

61
00:01:16,584 --> 00:01:17,787
Satu lembar surat sudah

62
00:01:17,807 --> 00:01:18,901
dibatalkan.

63
00:01:18,921 --> 00:01:20,729
Siapa yang menindaklanjutinya,

64
00:01:20,749 --> 00:01:22,181
itu pertanyaan berikutnya.

65
00:01:22,201 --> 00:01:23,747
Ikuti terus di Audira.

